# A trailing comment is not a supported spelling, and the refusal shows the
# value as written rather than a mangled form of it.
run available
exit 3
file tasks/M2-01.md
	---
	id: M2-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: yes # touches a shared surface
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: tasks/M2-01.md: exclusive must be yes or no, found: yes # touches a shared surface
